      "subject": "Documents needed before your start date",
      "labels": [
        "INBOX",
        "CATEGORY_UPDATES"
      ],
      "body": "Hi Alex,\n\nTo complete your onboarding, please upload two professional references and a copy of your work permit by November 20, 2026.\n\nThank you,\nRelecloud People Team"
